{"synopsis":"Karena situasi seperti IMF kedua perusahaan keamanan tempat Jang Taesan bekerja bangkrut dan dia menjadi seorang pengangguran yang berkeliaran di sekitar Noryangjindong Dia kehilangan nyawanya menyelamatkan seorang siswa sekolah dasar yang hampir tertabrak mobil Tapi terima kasih untuk perbuatan baiknya dia kembali ke 14 tahun lalu dan disambut dengan kehidupan baru\nNamun kegembiraan karena dibangkitkan itu berumur pendek Memikirkan harus mengikuti ujian masuk perguruan tinggi lagi membuat saya pusing  Tapi saya ingat semua masalah CSAT yang saya temui saat belajar dan grafik pasar saham yang saya lihat saat bekerja sebagai pialang saham  Kehidupan terakhir hancur tetapi kehidupan berikutnya ini akan menjadi sukses","alternative_title":"Updating","author":"","artist":"","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"b7a2f215-4da4-4f56-bbe1-ef20d3109fe6","number":"176","chapter":"176","title":"","date":"2025-08-03","released":"2025-08-03"},{"chapter_id":"603aa2eb-8fa5-4a0d-aefc-082ce4ab4c45","number":"175","chapter":"175","title":"","date":"2025-07-20","released":"2025-07-20"},{"chapter_id":"aa274fa5-c7b0-4a62-b896-ce1e988f6679","number":"174","chapter":"174","title":"","date":"2025-07-20","released":"2025-07-20"},{"chapter_id":"54bbf7f6-2755-4ee3-8a7b-5c174b915561","number":"173","chapter":"173","title":"","date":"2025-07-06","released":"2025-07-06"},{"chapter_id":"eac22fa8-1f3d-4591-9317-052b8d076807","number":"172","chapter":"172","title":"","date":"2025-06-19","released":"2025-06-19"},{"chapter_id":"d21d4722-7d6c-4fad-aeb1-26bea77818b2","number":"171","chapter":"171","title":"","date":"2025-06-17","released":"2025-06-17"},{"chapter_id":"a7b91a9f-4171-436b-a7b4-2d9b99d32628","number":"170","chapter":"170","title":"","date":"2025-05-29","released":"2025-05-29"},{"chapter_id":"5feb8857-2d5b-4f31-b286-12d12ba5615b","number":"169","chapter":"169","title":"","date":"2025-05-22","released":"2025-05-22"},{"chapter_id":"ce279fa3-3b9c-48b1-b81f-10649c8aa1f8","number":"168","chap